sequenceDiagram
  participant C as csdlc pr
  participant S as transaction store
  participant G as GitHub adapter
  participant W as foreground watch
  C->>S: commit + sync typed mutation intent
  S-->>C: durable intent receipt
  C->>G: idempotent PR mutation
  G-->>C: exact qualified readback
  C->>W: fixed deadline + poll policy
  loop until terminal/deadline/cancel
    W->>G: exact-head checks and issue readback
    G-->>W: typed observation
  end
  W-->>C: joined typed result, no persistent job
